{"about_the_game":"One mouse. One goal. Zero mercy. Reach the top of the lab, or fall trying.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision Platforming</h2><br>Every jump counts. Navigate narrow ledges and moving floors where one tiny slip means a long way down. With no checkpoints, gravity is your greatest enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/1fec64fccaf2f4a848ca3454dcf61353.poster.avif?t=1766689619\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/1fec64fccaf2f4a848ca3454dcf61353.webm?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/1fec64fccaf2f4a848ca3454dcf61353.mp4?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fear the Bubbles</h2><br>The bubbles are pure chaos. They float, they bounce, and they exist only to nudge you off your path. Master the art of dodging these hazards or get &quot;popped&quot; back to the bottom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/d9c76be8d9c2a09a599caaf48628c7c8.poster.avif?t=1766689619\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/d9c76be8d9c2a09a599caaf48628c7c8.webm?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/d9c76be8d9c2a09a599caaf48628c7c8.mp4?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Peak Rage Guaranteed</h2><br>Prepare for the most frustrating climb of your life. This is a &quot;masocore&quot; nightmare designed to push your temper to the breaking point. It\u2019s unfair, it\u2019s punishing, and it will make you want to throw your mouse through the monitor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/6a5da2a53bbe3c866dc236f2dd668fd1.poster.avif?t=1766689619\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/6a5da2a53bbe3c866dc236f2dd668fd1.webm?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/6a5da2a53bbe3c866dc236f2dd668fd1.mp4?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Troll</h2><br>Expect the unexpected. From disappearing floors to hidden traps, the level is designed to trick you. Stay sharp and learn the Cat\u2019s dirty tricks to survive the gauntlet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/70bd3b3e519d8355bf7d02a15670908e.poster.avif?t=1766689619\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/70bd3b3e519d8355bf7d02a15670908e.webm?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/70bd3b3e519d8355bf7d02a15670908e.mp4?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Joy of Suffering</h2><br>The struggle is the show. Bubble Rage is just as much fun to watch as it is to play. Share your most heartbreaking falls or laugh along as others tumble right before the finish line.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/1479ae3191a27bfc9bd9a718aedc8b62.poster.avif?t=1766689619\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/1479ae3191a27bfc9bd9a718aedc8b62.webm?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/1479ae3191a27bfc9bd9a718aedc8b62.mp4?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I like bubbles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/f800952b51307109f4b271e4571e79eb856f0b93.jpg"},{"name":"I hate bubbles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/485f11b6c4756cb2bec133c4a627be964f199846.jpg"},{"name":"I love bubbles!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/07d8b574a1a2989749e087d6c3faae3a85712e3f.jpg"},{"name":"Bubble Beater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/61d73188a29e5b382af123f555fa9f331f4b8c48.jpg"},{"name":"Bubble Eater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/5b0d987ac6a18b99863a946595d89fccc16db81b.jpg"},{"name":"Bubble Master!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/3a962b520e7ab7b3d7ab27d32b8f0afd7388c28c.jpg"},{"name":"Am I fast?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/39a2999e450d0a34ba8cb6897e1bb10457ba2fda.jpg"},{"name":"I am fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/8ebc09b8228c0b35661f0848dc7bf93e5753dd01.jpg"},{"name":"I am super fast!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/d02ab7b0480bae9d977fb2708e0343a89fdce189.jpg"},{"name":"That's not funny","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/4ca1a9a42f16f4180ac7158475c2d9f51dd4b079.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689630?t=1766689619","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689630?t=1766689619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/3418124b793d1c4f87195931d5716622868ac68a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766689619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/3418124b793d1c4f87195931d5716622868ac68a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766689619","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"One mouse. One goal. Zero mercy. Reach the top of the lab, or fall trying.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision Platforming</h2><br>Every jump counts. Navigate narrow ledges and moving floors where one tiny slip means a long way down. With no checkpoints, gravity is your greatest enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/1fec64fccaf2f4a848ca3454dcf61353.poster.avif?t=1766689619\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/1fec64fccaf2f4a848ca3454dcf61353.webm?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/1fec64fccaf2f4a848ca3454dcf61353.mp4?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fear the Bubbles</h2><br>The bubbles are pure chaos. They float, they bounce, and they exist only to nudge you off your path. Master the art of dodging these hazards or get &quot;popped&quot; back to the bottom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/d9c76be8d9c2a09a599caaf48628c7c8.poster.avif?t=1766689619\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/d9c76be8d9c2a09a599caaf48628c7c8.webm?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/d9c76be8d9c2a09a599caaf48628c7c8.mp4?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Peak Rage Guaranteed</h2><br>Prepare for the most frustrating climb of your life. This is a &quot;masocore&quot; nightmare designed to push your temper to the breaking point. It\u2019s unfair, it\u2019s punishing, and it will make you want to throw your mouse through the monitor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/6a5da2a53bbe3c866dc236f2dd668fd1.poster.avif?t=1766689619\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/6a5da2a53bbe3c866dc236f2dd668fd1.webm?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/extras/6a5da2a53bbe3c866dc236f2dd668fd1.mp4?t=1766689619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Troll</h2><br>Expect the unexpected. From disappearing floors to hidden traps, the level is designed to trick you. Stay sharp and learn the Cat\u2019s dirty tricks to survive the gauntlet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689630/